  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Third Party Monitoring (TPM) project of the Humanitarian and Resilience Programme (HARP) portfolio in Northeast Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CLEAR Global, in consortium with Fact Foundation (FACT) and IMPACT Initiatives (IMPACT), proposes to (1) conduct Third Party Monitoring (TPM) of the Humanitarian and Resilience Programme (HARP) to ensure HARP-funded humanitarian programming is performed effectively, compliantly, and is attuned towards the needs of affected populations, while promoting continuous learning through innovative best practises for HARP&#x2019;s Implementing Partners (IPs), as well as the wider humanitarian response; and (2) gather cash recipients&#x2019; feedback on cash and voucher assistance with Ground Truth Solutions as a sub-contracted supplier.</narrative>
  </description>
